{
  "id": "E297",
  "title": "Ways of Saying Happy New Year",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-02-05",
  "synopsis": "Learn different ways of saying Happy Spring Festival!",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/964/a0b7707b3b799258968779402e11d33eea4137b4.mp3?1548682959",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "还在说“春节快乐”？太过时了！\n\n小乐：爸爸妈妈，新年快乐！祝你们新的一年工作顺利，大吉大利！\n爸爸：谢谢你，小乐！我也祝你学习进步！\n妈妈：是啊，希望新的一年，你要好好学习，天天向上！\n小乐：谢谢爸爸妈妈！奶奶，新年快乐！祝您身体健康，笑口常开。\n奶奶：谢谢孙女！奶奶希望你新的一年，开开心心，快快乐乐！",
    "traditional": "還在說“春節快樂”？太過時了！\n\n小樂：爸爸媽媽，新年快樂！祝你們新的一年工作順利，大吉大利！\n爸爸：謝謝你，小樂！我也祝你學習進步！\n媽媽：是啊，希望新的一年，你要好好學習，天天向上！\n小樂：謝謝爸爸媽媽！奶奶，新年快樂！祝您身體健康，笑口常開。\n奶奶：謝謝孫女！奶奶希望你新的一年，開開心心，快快樂樂！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are you still saying “Happy New Year”? It’s so outdated!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：爸爸妈妈，新年快乐！",
      "traditional": "小樂：爸爸媽媽，新年快樂！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bà ba mā ma xīn nián kuài lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "祝你们新的一年工作顺利，大吉大利！",
      "traditional": "祝你們新的一年工作順利，大吉大利！",
      "pinyin": "zhù nǐ men xīn de yì nián gōng zuò shùn lì dà jí dà lì",
      "english": "Little Le: Mom and dad, Happy New Year!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I hope your work goes smoothly and that you have good fortune in the coming new year!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "爸爸：谢谢你，小乐！我也祝你学习进步！",
      "traditional": "爸爸：謝謝你，小樂！我也祝你學習進步！",
      "pinyin": "bà ba xiè xie nǐ xiǎo lè wǒ yě zhù nǐ xué xí jìn bù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: Thank you, Little Le! I also hope that you make progress in your studies!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "妈妈：是啊，希望新的一年，你要好好学习，天天向上！",
      "traditional": "媽媽：是啊，希望新的一年，你要好好學習，天天向上！",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shì a xī wàng xīn de yì nián nǐ yào hǎo hǎo xué xí tiān tiān xiàng shàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Yes. I hope that in the coming new year you will study hard and improve yourself every day!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小乐：谢谢爸爸妈妈！",
      "traditional": "小樂：謝謝爸爸媽媽！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè xiè xie bà ba mā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "奶奶，新年快乐！祝您身体健康，笑口常开。",
      "traditional": "奶奶，新年快樂！祝您身體健康，笑口常開。",
      "pinyin": "nǎi nai xīn nián kuài lè zhù nín shēn tǐ jiàn kāng xiào kǒu cháng kāi",
      "english": "Little Le: Thanks, mom and dad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Grandma, Happy New Year! I wish you good health and happiness all the time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "奶奶：谢谢孙女！奶奶希望你新的一年，开开心心，快快乐乐！",
      "traditional": "奶奶：謝謝孫女！奶奶希望你新的一年，開開心心，快快樂樂！",
      "pinyin": "nǎi nai xiè xie sūn nǚ nǎi nai xī wàng nǐ xīn de yì nián kāi kāi xīn xīn kuài kuài lè lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Grandma: Thank you, my granddaughter! Grandma wishes that your new year will be merry and filled with joy!"
    }
  ],
